  +CLIENTSIDEONLY
  +MISSILE
  +NOBLOCKMAP
  +NOTELEPORT
  +THRUACTORS
  +DONTBLAST
  +FORCEXYBILLBOARD
  +BOUNCEONWALLS
  WallBounceFactor 0.0
  Damage(0)
  Radius 3
  Height 3
  scale 2.5
  //Gravity 0.3
  States {
   Spawn:
    6P28 I 0
    6P28 I 1
    6P28 I 175
    stop
   Death:
